  "description": {
    "en": "Grapplesnake Tour Sniper is a low-powered pentagonal co-polyester designed for ultimate directional control, exceptional tension stability and heavy-hitting tournament play. Inspired by ALU Power, Tour Bite and Max Power, it delivers a softer feel, lower launch angle and partially pre-stretched construction for improved tension maintenance while maintaining excellent spin and precision.",

    "zh": "Grapplesnake Tour Sniper 是一款低动力五边形竞技聚酯球线，专为追求极致控制、稳定性及重炮型底线打法而设计。它融合了 ALU Power、Tour Bite 和 Max Power 的击球特性，同时拥有更柔和的手感、更低的发射角以及部分预拉伸结构，可有效降低聚酯球线初期掉磅，同时保持优秀的旋转和精准落点控制。"
  },

